  "statement": "A trading desk records the profit (possibly negative) of each of `n` consecutive days. A **streak** is a non-empty run of consecutive days. Print the largest possible total profit of a streak.\n\n**Input.** First line `n`. Second line `n` integers.\n\n**Output.** One integer.\n\n**Example.**\n\nInput:\n```\n6\n3 -4 5 -1 2 -6\n```\nOutput:\n```\n6\n```",
